{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and share your own world\u2014this is a high-freedom idle simulation game with a built-in editor. Manage diverse resources, recruit workers, develop industries, govern domestic affairs, and summon legendary characters to turn the tide of fate! The game offers three official worlds to explore, plus full support for creating and sharing your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/8c1363e2866a5236630d291d68d1faa1.avif?t=1764907383\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance every resource\u2014input, output, chain and yield\u2014to unlock new tech and grow your realm. One shortfall can topple the rest: think like a statesman, not a hoarder. Recruit enigmatic heroes to tip the scales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/0a6b39f097053385351ba3304a578532.poster.avif?t=1764907383\" width=700 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/0a6b39f097053385351ba3304a578532.webm?t=1764907383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/0a6b39f097053385351ba3304a578532.mp4?t=1764907383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pop the resizable window anywhere on your screen and let your empire tick while you work, stream, or nap.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/c158beb62a0aef00d9a2aa1352d20505.avif?t=1764907383\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three-Kingdoms Conquest: Start as a nobody in the burning chaos of the Three Kingdoms\u2014raise armies, bankroll cities, poach generals, charm legendary beauties, then smash every rival until the last throne is yours and a new dynasty bears your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Golden Lotus: Drop 21st-century smarts into a brutal past: rig the system, play hero or villain, pile up gold, seize the throne, pocket hearts and daggers alike, and grind every old bully under your boot until you\u2019re the warlord who writes the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Famine Legend: Merging the brutal survival punch of Don't Starve with the last-man-standing tension of I Am Legend, the game builds a twin-world system: the surface and the shadow beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start naked in the wild, juggling health, hunger and sanity\u2014scavenge, craft, fight off night terrors just to see another dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/9c3a7362139c614d0af55da4e31486d6.avif?t=1764907383\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Genesis Mode, you can create a World of your own. You can introduce new functional modules, add every kind of resource, set each interaction\u2019s detailed behavior and the logic behind it, create characters together with their images and back-stories, and weave in any plot you want\u2014all edited with ease on a visual relationship graph that lets you control absolutely everything in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/39aa6a32e6eda56e984c49e81f7774fb.poster.avif?t=1764907383\" width=700 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/39aa6a32e6eda56e984c49e81f7774fb.webm?t=1764907383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/39aa6a32e6eda56e984c49e81f7774fb.mp4?t=1764907383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/7f7cf0db5b381645470c5e455a3f53d2.avif?t=1764907383\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can export your self-made world to share with others, and you can also import maps created by fellow players to enjoy! In the official release, full Steam Workshop support will be enabled\u2014letting you exchange and interact with creators around the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/6a7bd32c6d14f0494673db118a9abdfb.poster.avif?t=1764907383\" width=700 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/6a7bd32c6d14f0494673db118a9abdfb.webm?t=1764907383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/6a7bd32c6d14f0494673db118a9abdfb.mp4?t=1764907383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a sandbox simulator built for idle play: we only craft the underlying logic\u2014everything about the world\u2019s style, its story, and how the game unfolds is entirely up to you.</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972520?t=1764907383","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/3cc3d0b007c849362575b7557a04090b541004ea/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764907383","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/f1d993d534da2c391c5e94edec9cf9e2a9353ad5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764907383","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/f1d993d534da2c391c5e94edec9cf9e2a9353ad5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764907383","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Some in-game images may contain content such as \"revealing clothing\" or \"sexual innuendo,\" which may not be suitable for all age groups."},"demos":[{"appid":3984430,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and share your own world\u2014this is a high-freedom idle simulation game with a built-in editor. Manage diverse resources, recruit workers, develop industries, govern domestic affairs, and summon legendary characters to turn the tide of fate! The game offers three official worlds to explore, plus full support for creating and sharing your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/8c1363e2866a5236630d291d68d1faa1.avif?t=1764907383\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance every resource\u2014input, output, chain and yield\u2014to unlock new tech and grow your realm. One shortfall can topple the rest: think like a statesman, not a hoarder. Recruit enigmatic heroes to tip the scales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/0a6b39f097053385351ba3304a578532.poster.avif?t=1764907383\" width=700 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/0a6b39f097053385351ba3304a578532.webm?t=1764907383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/0a6b39f097053385351ba3304a578532.mp4?t=1764907383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pop the resizable window anywhere on your screen and let your empire tick while you work, stream, or nap.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/c158beb62a0aef00d9a2aa1352d20505.avif?t=1764907383\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three-Kingdoms Conquest: Start as a nobody in the burning chaos of the Three Kingdoms\u2014raise armies, bankroll cities, poach generals, charm legendary beauties, then smash every rival until the last throne is yours and a new dynasty bears your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Golden Lotus: Drop 21st-century smarts into a brutal past: rig the system, play hero or villain, pile up gold, seize the throne, pocket hearts and daggers alike, and grind every old bully under your boot until you\u2019re the warlord who writes the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Famine Legend: Merging the brutal survival punch of Don't Starve with the last-man-standing tension of I Am Legend, the game builds a twin-world system: the surface and the shadow beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start naked in the wild, juggling health, hunger and sanity\u2014scavenge, craft, fight off night terrors just to see another dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/9c3a7362139c614d0af55da4e31486d6.avif?t=1764907383\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Genesis Mode, you can create a World of your own. You can introduce new functional modules, add every kind of resource, set each interaction\u2019s detailed behavior and the logic behind it, create characters together with their images and back-stories, and weave in any plot you want\u2014all edited with ease on a visual relationship graph that lets you control absolutely everything in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/39aa6a32e6eda56e984c49e81f7774fb.poster.avif?t=1764907383\" width=700 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/39aa6a32e6eda56e984c49e81f7774fb.webm?t=1764907383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/39aa6a32e6eda56e984c49e81f7774fb.mp4?t=1764907383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/7f7cf0db5b381645470c5e455a3f53d2.avif?t=1764907383\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can export your self-made world to share with others, and you can also import maps created by fellow players to enjoy! In the official release, full Steam Workshop support will be enabled\u2014letting you exchange and interact with creators around the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/6a7bd32c6d14f0494673db118a9abdfb.poster.avif?t=1764907383\" width=700 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/6a7bd32c6d14f0494673db118a9abdfb.webm?t=1764907383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/extras/6a7bd32c6d14f0494673db118a9abdfb.mp4?t=1764907383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a sandbox simulator built for idle play: we only craft the underlying logic\u2014everything about the world\u2019s style, its story, and how the game unfolds is entirely up to you.</strong></h2>","developers":["BambooCopter"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972520/f75479c3c4ca3e9be7f82fb33db43ffdc630208a/header.jpg?t=1764907383","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"The game is in a temporary testing phase. If it has infringed upon your rights, please contact us to remove the relevant content.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3972520/1646910038/ba298c320bffa55380fcee7c8a4788948a681fbe/1756168819/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758873571","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3972520/164691